# oRPC Package (`@lyterion/orpc`)

## Procedures

```
publicProcedure        no auth, rate limited
  └── protectedProcedure  owner session (context.session)
```

Every dashboard data route is `protectedProcedure`. `publicProcedure` is only for health checks.

## Context

- `session`: from `auth.api.getSession()` (`@lyterion/core`)
- `headers`: raw request headers

## Routers

`src/routers/index.ts` holds `appRouter`. Add one file per domain under `src/routers/` and spread it into `appRouter` once it grows past a couple of routes.

```typescript
const { data } = useQuery(orpc.me.queryOptions());
```
